OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's knitted speed trap
OL,4,A'fooling drivers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of villagers have turned to an
OL,7,Funusual method to tackle speeding
OL,8,Ftraffic, creating knitted roadside
OL,9,Fcharacters that they say are
OL,10,Fsuccessfully slowing drivers down.
OL,12,FMembers of the Fillongley Knit and
OL,13,FNatter group have dotted knitted
OL,14,Fmannequins around the Warwickshire
OL,15,Fvillage in an effort to encourage
OL,16,Fmotorists to take more care on local
OL,17,Froads.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
