OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's knitted speed trap
OL,4,A'fooling drivers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the creations are knitted
OL,7,Fchildren carrying road safety messages,
OL,8,Fzebras perched above crossing signs and
OL,9,Fan RAF character holding a knitted
OL,10,Fspeed gun.
OL,12,FThe displays were introduced amid
OL,13,Fongoing concerns about road safety,
OL,14,Fparticularly around a busy crossroads
OL,15,Fin the village that residents say has a
OL,16,Fhistory of accidents.
